          "Title": "1.20 - AUTHORITY",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"b0\">\n               This Ordinance is adopted pursuant to the provisions of Chapter 40A of the General\n               Laws of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts, and amendments thereto, hereinafter referred\n               to as the \"Zoning Act\". Certain provisions of this Ordinance are also adopted pursuant\n               to Chapter 565 of the acts of 1979, as amended by Chapter 387 of the Acts of 1980.\n               </p></div>",
